n参考： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pfozR1Agr60p0DOYTC_UWeCkiDQzB7vW?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tkkr105sq/works/49", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c6e805/uploads/origins/0969bb5d-6270-4bb4-920d-eff32bf2e46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89731c3da06e637149e15b6dbbbe2104", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c6e805/uploads/origins/0969bb5d-6270-4bb4-920d-eff32bf2e46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89731c3da06e637149e15b6dbbbe2104, https://si.imgix.net/e7c6e805/uploads/origins/0969bb5d-6270-4bb4-920d-eff32bf2e46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da964fead37b1d4cbc09e63b2b4c77c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7c6e805/uploads/origins/0969bb5d-6270-4bb4-920d-eff32bf2e46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fd57827e1d6e73f1a3fe4b800118b41 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めてリクエストを出させて頂きます。\n\n・キャラ\n\nノア\nhttps://ek1mem0.wiki.fc2.com/upload_dir/e/ek1mem0/1362e0b3ed2d7d2017998df01d36e09b.jpeg\n\nのぞみ\nhttps://ek1mem0.wiki.fc2.com/upload_dir/e/ek1mem0/8384188ab5920d9e1399d0d66f61e1d4.jpeg\nの水着姿をお願いします。\n\n・服装\n\nノア\n↓\nブラ参考\nhttps://www.heatswimwear.com/black-slide-triangle-top/\n\nショーツ参考\nhttp://1.bp.blogspot.com/-E5hVh3R8i_w/UrEdyX6YiTI/AAAAAAAAhCo/Xg4V6bjH8HE/s1600/147.jpg\n\n色はネイビー無地で体型は以下を参考にパンタグラフは無しでお願いします。\n\n体型参考\nhttps://ek1mem0.wiki.fc2.com/upload_dir/e/ek1mem0/374c7fb7c37d5ff7311f03de998d406a.jpeg\n\nのぞみ\n↓\nブラ参考\nhttps://m.shein.com/eur/Triangle-Halter-Bikini-Top-p-2181617-cat-2278.html?ref=eur&rep=dir&ret=meur\n\nショーツ参考\nhttps://www.heatswimwear.com/black-tie-side-bottom/\n\n色は黒無地で体型はキャラ欄URLから推測でお願いします。\n\n・構図\nビーチで2人が腰に手を当ててポーズする立ち姿をお願いします。\n(左…ノア、右…のぞみ)\n\nまた可能でしたら背景に差分をお願いします↓\n\nノア\n・ビーチバレーで遊ぶ様子(身体や水着に汗や砂がついている)\n参考\nhttps://imagenavi.jp/search/detail.asp?id=30405928\n\n\n・ブラを外し右手に持って振り返る顔が赤面な後ろ姿\n(身体は濡れて左手で食い込み直し)\n\n\nのぞみ\n・ショーツの食い込みを指で引っ張って直す後ろ姿\n\n・波でブラが外れてしまって手ブラ\n(上手く胸を隠せてなくて近くでブラが舞っている)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tkkr105sq/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c81f11d9/uploads/origins/8bd2690a-ba5d-407d-ad1b-dfa982c9715b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a729bde1ea6f849debae42f4ee4bbc91", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c81f11d9/uploads/origins/8bd2690a-ba5d-407d-ad1b-dfa982c9715b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a729bde1ea6f849debae42f4ee4bbc91, https://si.imgix.net/c81f11d9/uploads/origins/8bd2690a-ba5d-407d-ad1b-dfa982c9715b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9174628c444b6b1b4beaf941136c33d7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c81f11d9/uploads/origins/8bd2690a-ba5d-407d-ad1b-dfa982c9715b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=23f926d1be338b5c04934a1a963357b5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tkkr105sq/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3fedc2b8/uploads/origins/79a59973-1e2d-4803-9c0e-79ff44d5243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca78c911fd0738694737e2f562a119a3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3fedc2b8/uploads/origins/79a59973-1e2d-4803-9c0e-79ff44d5243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca78c911fd0738694737e2f562a119a3, https://si.imgix.net/3fedc2b8/uploads/origins/79a59973-1e2d-4803-9c0e-79ff44d5243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59e89f7ec2f8c9962fc612c699757f50 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3fedc2b8/uploads/origins/79a59973-1e2d-4803-9c0e-79ff44d5243b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50120542e26d0c02b666d66beea2e4c2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "アンとアリサの絵ありがとうございました。二人ともとても可愛くていいおっぱいです。\nせっかくなのでもっと広い範囲を見てみたくなりました。\nカンバスサイズを左右と上の部分を広げてさらに描き足して頂くことって可能でしょうか？\n具体的にはアリサの右脚とアンの左脚二人の頭頂部です。\n\n背景は透明のままで大丈夫ですが、\nもし可能でしたらアンのおっぱいサイズをアリサと同じぐらいに大きくして\n二人がブーツ履いている差分もお願いしたいです。\n\nhttps://gbf-wiki.com/index.php?plugin=attach&refer=img&openfile=3040132000_01_full.png\nhttps://gbf-wiki.com/index.php?plugin=attach&refer=img&openfile=3040132000_02_full.png\nhttps://img.gamewith.jp/article_tools/pricone-re/gacha/146934_t.jpg\nhttps://gbf-wiki.com/index.php?plugin=attach&refer=img&openfile=3030179000_01_full.png\nhttps://gbf-wiki.com/index.php?plugin=attach&refer=img&openfile=3030179000_02_full.png\nhttps://img.gamewith.jp/article_tools/pricone-re/gacha/93551_t.jpg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tkkr105sq/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37556acb/uploads/origins/bf11f3a6-e099-404a-9fc2-b04658a72425?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d8554e059e6a0d0af5403acb111d32e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37556acb/uploads/origins/bf11f3a6-e099-404a-9fc2-b04658a72425?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d8554e059e6a0d0af5403acb111d32e, https://si.imgix.net/37556acb/uploads/origins/bf11f3a6-e099-404a-9fc2-b04658a72425?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05c4c5af1cb168eab0564a79e1982ca1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37556acb/uploads/origins/bf11f3a6-e099-404a-9fc2-b04658a72425?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bbc421d662bdf6e6cbad24b36217a94 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "プリコネよりアンとアリサの二人が上半身はおっぱい出して\n下半身は座って開脚